WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:16.761
looked at the robots.

2
00:00:16.781 --> 00:00:19.203
"Cozlin! Do something!"

3
00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:22.666
Cozlin held up her hand, but nothing happened.

4
00:00:22.686 --> 00:00:26.009
"I don't have my super powers either!"

5
00:00:28.171 --> 00:00:29.352
The robots moved closer.

6
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.942
Cozlin grabbed Roxy and pulled her into a small opening in the wall.

7
00:00:35.962 --> 00:00:38.083
"Follow me!"

8
00:00:38.584 --> 00:00:39.264
Cozlin said.

9
00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:42.186
They crawled through a narrow tunnel.

10
00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:45.889
It was too small for any of those robots to enter.

11
00:00:47.069 --> 00:00:49.671
The floor was slippery with thick, dark sludge.

12
00:00:49.691 --> 00:00:53.614
"There's something on the floor," Roxy said.

13
00:00:53.634 --> 00:00:56.976
"It's motor oil," Cozlin said.

14
00:00:56.996 --> 00:01:00.198
"Maybe oil drains into this tunnel."

15
00:01:00.218 --> 00:01:02.840
"Yuck!" Roxy said.

16
00:01:05.132 --> 00:01:06.793
They reached a small chamber and stood up.

17
00:01:06.813 --> 00:01:10.534
"That was close," Cozlin said.

18
00:01:11.795 --> 00:01:12.935
Roxy frowned.

19
00:01:13.776 --> 00:01:16.037
"We're covered in motor oil!"

20
00:01:17.297 --> 00:01:18.138
Cozlin shrugged.

21
00:01:18.158 --> 00:01:20.298
"At least we're safe now."

22
00:01:20.318 --> 00:01:23.920
"Safe?" Roxy said.

23
00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.801
"Are you kidding?

24
00:01:26.161 --> 00:01:30.903
We're trapped in a tunnel a million light-years from home without super powers!

25
00:01:31.623 --> 00:01:33.244
And we're covered in motor oil!"

26
00:01:34.528 --> 00:01:35.709
Cozlin rolled her eyes.

27
00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:39.071
"This is why I work alone.

28
00:01:40.352 --> 00:01:42.694
I don't have to listen to people who complain."

29
00:01:42.714 --> 00:01:46.716
"I wish you were working alone!"

30
00:01:47.077 --> 00:01:47.777
Roxy said.

31
00:01:47.797 --> 00:01:50.859
"Because then I'd be at home right now!

32
00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.841
I'm only here because of you.

33
00:01:54.802 --> 00:01:56.563
You terrorized Metro City.

34
00:01:57.444 --> 00:01:59.685
You dragged me all the way out here.

35
00:02:01.246 --> 00:02:03.688
You said it was fine to go through that energy shield.

36
00:02:04.816 --> 00:02:07.278
And now I'm covered in motor oil!"

37
00:02:08.278 --> 00:02:09.579
Cozlin folded her arms.

38
00:02:09.599 --> 00:02:12.761
"You already complained about that part."

39
00:02:15.203 --> 00:02:17.224
"Grr!" Roxy stamped her foot.

40
00:02:18.365 --> 00:02:19.306
Cozlin frowned.

41
00:02:19.326 --> 00:02:22.528
"Let's just figure out how to get out of here."

42
00:02:22.548 --> 00:02:25.270
"Yes," Roxy said.

43
00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:28.052
"And then I'll figure out how to get home."

44
00:02:28.072 --> 00:02:31.154
"Fine," Cozlin said.

45
00:02:31.174 --> 00:02:34.516
"I can handle the robots on my own."

46
00:02:35.716 --> 00:02:37.137
"Good," Roxy said.

47
00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:39.898
"They're not my problem anyway."

48
00:02:39.918 --> 00:02:43.480
"That's right," Cozlin said.

49
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:47.483
"And if one of them goes to Earth, I won't have to help you.

50
00:02:48.303 --> 00:02:50.424
It'll be your problem and not mine."

51
00:02:52.485 --> 00:02:54.266
Roxy remembered what Eldin had said.

52
00:02:55.707 --> 00:02:58.188
The robots had taken over every planet they invaded.

53
00:02:59.249 --> 00:03:01.670
It was only a matter of time before one arrived on Earth.

54
00:03:04.192 --> 00:03:04.752
She sighed.

55
00:03:05.605 --> 00:03:07.867
"You're right.

56
00:03:09.228 --> 00:03:12.110
Let's figure out how to get out of here and stop those robots."

57
00:03:16.774 --> 00:03:19.917
They crawled through another tunnel and arrived in a hallway that sloped upward.

58
00:03:23.921 --> 00:03:26.223
heading back to the surface," Roxy said.

59
00:03:27.183 --> 00:03:30.266
Suddenly the walls around them began to shift and change shape.

60
00:03:31.147 --> 00:03:32.168
An arm popped out.

61
00:03:34.188 --> 00:03:35.089
Cozlin gulped.

62
00:03:35.909 --> 00:03:38.271
"The walls are turning into robots!"

63
00:03:40.913 --> 00:03:44.095
They ran up the hallway as robots stomped after them.

64
00:03:45.315 --> 00:03:46.436
Roxy pointed ahead of them.

65
00:03:46.456 --> 00:03:49.018
"There's that energy shield again!"

66
00:03:51.419 --> 00:03:54.522
They ran through the shield, and right away Roxy felt different.

67
00:03:56.483 --> 00:04:01.286
Whiz-hoo! Her eye laser beams blasted a robot that had just stepped through the energy shield.

68
00:04:02.247 --> 00:04:03.888
"Yes!" Roxy cried.

69
00:04:05.076 --> 00:04:07.417
Cozlin grinned as she blasted the next robot.

70
00:04:10.838 --> 00:04:18.401
Soon the two heroes had destroyed robot.

71
00:04:18.422 --> 00:04:19.922
Boom! The wall behind them exploded.

72
00:04:20.963 --> 00:04:23.023
They spun around to see a much bigger robot.

73
00:04:23.043 --> 00:04:26.225
"Uh-oh," Cozlin said.

74
00:04:27.065 --> 00:04:28.266
Roxy got ready to fight.

75
00:04:29.546 --> 00:04:31.467
Then she heard Cozlin's device beep.

76
00:04:32.207 --> 00:04:34.048
The beeping got faster and louder.

77
00:04:36.076 --> 00:04:38.578
"Something is alive here," Cozlin said.

78
00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:42.342
A familiar—but angry—voice came from the robot.

79
00:04:42.963 --> 00:04:44.044
"Rocket Girl?"

80
00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:47.827
Roxy scratched her head.

81
00:04:47.847 --> 00:04:51.290
"Huh?" The robot's head opened.

82
00:04:55.394 --> 00:04:57.116
Dr. Odd sat inside.
